.TH sandogasa-report 1 2026-08-12 "sandogasa 0.19.4" "Sandogasa Manual"
.SH NAME
sandogasa\-report \- Activity reporting for Fedora, EPEL, and CentOS SIG packaging work
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsandogasa\-report\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Activity reporting for Fedora, EPEL, and CentOS SIG packaging work
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH COMMANDS
.SS sandogasa-report config
\fBsandogasa\-report config\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Interactively set per\-user overrides in `~/.config/sandogasa\-report/config.toml`
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Main config file to enumerate domains / forge instances from. Without one, there are no instances to configure
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS sandogasa-report report
\fBsandogasa\-report report\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-u\fR|\fB\-\-user\fR] <\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-domain\fR> [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-until\fR] [\fB\-\-period\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-bugzilla\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-bodhi\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-koji\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-gitlab\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-github\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-forgejo\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-sourcehut\fR] [\fB\-\-detailed\fR]... [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Generate an activity report across one or more domains
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Path to main config file (domains, groups)
.TP
\fB\-u\fR, \fB\-\-user\fR \fI<USER>\fR
FAS username to report on
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-domain\fR \fI<DOMAIN>\fR
Domain(s) to report on (defined in config)
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<SINCE>\fR
Start date (inclusive, YYYY\-MM\-DD)
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fI<UNTIL>\fR
End date (inclusive, YYYY\-MM\-DD, default: today)
.TP
\fB\-\-period\fR \fI<PERIOD>\fR
Reporting period (e.g. 2026Q1, 2026H1)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-bugzilla\fR
Skip Bugzilla queries
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-bodhi\fR
Skip Bodhi queries
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-koji\fR
Skip Koji queries
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-gitlab\fR
Skip GitLab queries
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-github\fR
Skip GitHub queries
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-forgejo\fR
Skip Forgejo queries
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-sourcehut\fR
Skip Sourcehut queries
.TP
\fB\-\-detailed\fR
Include per\-item details. Repeat for deeper detail — level 1 (`\-\-detailed`) lists each Bodhi update but summarizes multi\-build ones as "N builds", level 2 (`\-\-detailed \-\-detailed`) lists every build. Koji, GitLab, and Bugzilla ignore the difference between levels 1 and 2 (no deeper layer to expose)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output as JSON instead of Markdown
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Write output to file instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print progress to stderr
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
